  "intro": "Se você está pesquisando no Google termos como “roteiro Peru 10 dias”, “itinerário Peru 7 dias”, “circuito Peru tudo incluído” […]",
  "content_html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Se você está pesquisando no Google termos como <strong>“roteiro Peru 10 dias”, “itinerário Peru 7 dias”, <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">“circuito Peru tudo incluído”</a></strong> ou <strong>“melhor <a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\">rota para Machu Picchu</a>”</strong>, aqui você encontra as opções mais vendidas e com maior procura para 2026.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Descubra as <strong>rotas mais completas, organizadas e fáceis de reservar</strong> para conhecer o melhor do Peru.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"1-rota-cl-assica-lima-cusco-machu-picchu-7-dias\"> 1 Rota Clássica: Lima + Cusco + Machu Picchu (7 Dias)</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/J8yA-CZ-fIOO_UEYdPiBG1l5hvtXoZkK4Ex1nNI4Pn2_y9wmIn7WUqpWOpNePOy-xASn99Zk4I4KLmdJJ58F5bp3fL8z1X8q7t0eTXDFVNA?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/J8yA-CZ-fIOO_UEYdPiBG1l5hvtXoZkK4Ex1nNI4Pn2_y9wmIn7WUqpWOpNePOy-xASn99Zk4I4KLmdJJ58F5bp3fL8z1X8q7t0eTXDFVNA?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/J9RlrWerrbD-sG2QY7NznDCvOjaoJcq8yyHWY6XAdqyVwyDCRJjhjTjhVvgY4o863OEXezDvKyXortyaeiSovDVbjuYT8inq3aSGs5082C4?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/J9RlrWerrbD-sG2QY7NznDCvOjaoJcq8yyHWY6XAdqyVwyDCRJjhjTjhVvgY4o863OEXezDvKyXortyaeiSovDVbjuYT8inq3aSGs5082C4?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/XH_FAxLV7PHWoJXe7oB07tFeCf8AoUlQRp-2baSDOgC1iZW4C5rPGW8RUHO3tg9PXFFPqDZnxCLI1FgMejKR7xsmxpijmIOoIDZ2SAzm4CY?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/XH_FAxLV7PHWoJXe7oB07tFeCf8AoUlQRp-2baSDOgC1iZW4C5rPGW8RUHO3tg9PXFFPqDZnxCLI1FgMejKR7xsmxpijmIOoIDZ2SAzm4CY?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Roteiro Peru 7 dias / Itinerário Peru 1 semana</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Ideal para:</strong><br>Primeira viagem ao Peru</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Alta conversão porque inclui:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>City tour em Lima</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Voo interno para Cusco</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vale Sagrado</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trem + ingresso para Machu Picchu</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hotéis e traslados</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> É a rota mais procurada por brasileiros e a mais fácil de vender em pacote completo.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"2-rota-aventura-lima-paracas-huacachina-cusco-8-10-dias\"> 2 Rota Aventura: Lima + Paracas + Huacachina + Cusco (8–10 Dias)</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/lSoVvQdYQ-WvTKBAbf2BUJ2I6MZSWqIEtm9qh3K2jnA_UtWK_rGd2AMj8juBy1snK651NqM_aaJEczyXL2DbnHrwDZW93PShhVlrv6sUg84?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/lSoVvQdYQ-WvTKBAbf2BUJ2I6MZSWqIEtm9qh3K2jnA_UtWK_rGd2AMj8juBy1snK651NqM_aaJEczyXL2DbnHrwDZW93PShhVlrv6sUg84?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/_eN9j-aqlEYUlu8oBGNzOS6LUEmAgYS8Lws9d4vHpuo90VTdWyHpwpvBUrYPPHufJPlyPQivIIxNPBZn7XSy_ODlCa5r1XsGGfe_ZsVxVqc?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/_eN9j-aqlEYUlu8oBGNzOS6LUEmAgYS8Lws9d4vHpuo90VTdWyHpwpvBUrYPPHufJPlyPQivIIxNPBZn7XSy_ODlCa5r1XsGGfe_ZsVxVqc?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4s2xeFzSdmj0aF-eNWNsB3XFZkEBoELJZLSTLDJ8U5rkod3-3PxHRYmrHukJY-liNgDMu8YzjbXkJJenPeUkcS5a2EOiwCsR8XK_t9-1OuI?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4s2xeFzSdmj0aF-eNWNsB3XFZkEBoELJZLSTLDJ8U5rkod3-3PxHRYmrHukJY-liNgDMu8YzjbXkJJenPeUkcS5a2EOiwCsR8XK_t9-1OuI?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Roteiro Peru 10 dias / Peru completo itinerário</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inclui:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ilhas Ballestas</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sandboard em Huacachina</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sobrevoo das Linhas de Nazca</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cusco + Machu Picchu</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Excelente para vender experiências combinadas e pacotes completos.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"3-rota-sul-andina-arequipa-colca-puno-cusco-10-12-dias\"> 3 Rota Sul Andina: Arequipa + Colca + Puno + Cusco (10–12 Dias)</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/DW_RadhjcwkHeCAdYE0K93C22pVFwauW-JnSHqXVCaJrCLKiTDpppBHTNTZx2ZinoqfHH7CDuWXAQe_5wkGihrGJwC9CZNlmS09aQm_OOP8?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/DW_RadhjcwkHeCAdYE0K93C22pVFwauW-JnSHqXVCaJrCLKiTDpppBHTNTZx2ZinoqfHH7CDuWXAQe_5wkGihrGJwC9CZNlmS09aQm_OOP8?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/q_ejvAEf2dvuY6-4wP-Hr7uSZwoFBQJ5ErhpL-TgaSELTP5yTVDfXjbZ92VRT1qry4KT0SxqbLJgbpfLguPtjDjuNLo7lgAY1nYnS5W-R-Y?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/q_ejvAEf2dvuY6-4wP-Hr7uSZwoFBQJ5ErhpL-TgaSELTP5yTVDfXjbZ92VRT1qry4KT0SxqbLJgbpfLguPtjDjuNLo7lgAY1nYnS5W-R-Y?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/N83IDjZSRviOSaKV6yI4MPwuBA2ZjDC-asedRxZkotCAsbT7_iPeBMOIJKzLZlGtQiNBMfWfYOX6ispPuTEwWWhMkMiAT5CS9XPwX7RSIec?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/N83IDjZSRviOSaKV6yI4MPwuBA2ZjDC-asedRxZkotCAsbT7_iPeBMOIJKzLZlGtQiNBMfWfYOX6ispPuTEwWWhMkMiAT5CS9XPwX7RSIec?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Circuito Sul do Peru 12 dias</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inclui:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Cânion do Colca</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lago Titicaca</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Montanha das 7 Cores</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Machu Picchu</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Rota premium → maior ticket médio e mais rentável.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"4-rota-relax-cultura-praias-do-norte-cusco-9-dias\"> 4 Rota Relax + Cultura: Praias do Norte + Cusco (9 Dias)</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4BA0OPdX_9yx-tVpZb1IYeTib-Ww2AB5cNqdx4frOonps1OwR6qYSI3Fy56ueO4htH43EbdZFkT2Jmk9ibSKm2MmfI1EcXVEZx-3yQx8NPk?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4BA0OPdX_9yx-tVpZb1IYeTib-Ww2AB5cNqdx4frOonps1OwR6qYSI3Fy56ueO4htH43EbdZFkT2Jmk9ibSKm2MmfI1EcXVEZx-3yQx8NPk?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.civitatis.com/f/peru/punta-sal/punta-sal.jpg\" alt=\"https://www.civitatis.com/f/peru/punta-sal/punta-sal.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/-hAdLW7KhOqgBDpJ-cc5R5mMZxNz27z7fOA2NQEdgj-OAxwW37p3MbZQhJVuApQgo0W2G8HXmeR792SVR_7wkAZcl-I4znlWwiLZ2m7B9es?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/-hAdLW7KhOqgBDpJ-cc5R5mMZxNz27z7fOA2NQEdgj-OAxwW37p3MbZQhJVuApQgo0W2G8HXmeR792SVR_7wkAZcl-I4znlWwiLZ2m7B9es?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Praias do Peru + Machu Picchu roteiro</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Ideal para:</strong><br>Viajantes que buscam cultura + descanso</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Combina praias paradisíacas com a experiência histórica de Machu Picchu.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"5-rota-natureza-amaz-onia-cusco-8-dias\"> 5 Rota Natureza: Amazônia + Cusco (8 Dias)</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0e/df/97/09/amazon-rainforest-lodge.jpg?h=500&amp;s=1&amp;w=900\" alt=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0e/df/97/09/amazon-rainforest-lodge.jpg?h=500&amp;s=1&amp;w=900\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.tacdn.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-674x446/06/6c/31/c7.jpg\" alt=\"https://media.tacdn.com/media/attractions-splice-spp-674x446/06/6c/31/c7.jpg\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/liwcPVuBeOcEkKCyo9BnVsdBL3_UJzYHnUTzeaqqUhG319Nz68rQTEO7xgBf-CkO00GMVYjG8gywZ4N8ewkfJdaWtFqb2o1zrt42QmTC7fE?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/liwcPVuBeOcEkKCyo9BnVsdBL3_UJzYHnUTzeaqqUhG319Nz68rQTEO7xgBf-CkO00GMVYjG8gywZ4N8ewkfJdaWtFqb2o1zrt42QmTC7fE?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Amazonas Peru + Machu Picchu tour</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inclui:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Lodge na selva amazônica</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Passeios noturnos na floresta</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cusco e Machu Picchu</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Ideal para quem busca natureza, aventura e cultura em uma única viagem.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> Como Tornar Essas Rotas Mais Vendáveis</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Use títulos estratégicos como:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> “Roteiro Peru 10 dias: itinerário completo + preços 2026”<br> “Melhor rota para viajar ao Peru pela primeira vez”<br> “Quanto custa viajar ao Peru em 7, 10 ou 15 dias”<br> “Circuito Peru tudo incluído: ofertas atualizadas”</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> As Rotas Mais Rentáveis para Monetizar</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> Machu Picchu (ingressos + trem + hotel)<br> Tours combinados (Nazca + Huacachina)<br> Circuitos de 10–12 dias<br> Pacotes tudo incluído</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> Viaje ao Peru com Segurança e Conforto</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Viaje ao Peru com <strong>GT Peru Travel</strong> sem se preocupar com nada.<br>Incluímos hotéis selecionados, tours guiados e Machu Picchu garantido.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>Reserve hoje antes que os preços 2026 aumentem e as vagas se esgotem.</strong></p>\n",
